      "description": "<p>Number of pension beneficiaries classified by type of pension and sex, distinguishing between means-tested and non means-tested benefits. Pension types cover old age, anticipated and partial pensions, disability pensions, survivors’ pensions and early retirement benefits due to reduced capacity to work or labour market reasons. Figures are expressed as persons, as the double counting (the same person receiving more than one pension) is generally removed from the data.</p>",
